    "ACCEPTED applies to the declared source-bound browser experience contracts; Sounding Line qualification, integration and owner PRODUCT_ACCEPTED are separate authorities.",
    "All 38 recordings were inspected over their full duration via chronological 2fps diagnostic sheets; seven short critical segments were additionally inspected as 25fps ordered source-recording frames. Neither method is native playback, refresh-rate measurement or real-device frame-time instrumentation.",
    "Paired contexts use canonical preauthenticated synthetic account-session cookies for setup and then perform a real UI Join authorized by the server. They do not capture a complete phone password-entry roundtrip. Generic captures separately demonstrate actual product sign-in/navigation with safe return intent.",
    "Paired phone contexts have isMobile and hasTouch true. Generic MOBILE cases are phone-width keyboard/responsive captures. This proves emulated paths, not physical touch accuracy, QR camera scanning, device ergonomics or native assistive technology.",
    "Guided Lens and Reach demo are honest camera-free/simulated tiers. Native/world-tracked AR, real webcam pointing accuracy, physical hardware, live providers, OAuth/mail delivery and owner acceptance are not proved.",
    "Normal Journal captures visibly report animated-opening fallback; reduced captures report readable page-turn fallback. They preserve usable Journal content and canonical continuation, and do not justify a claim that every cinematic animation completed smoothly.",
    "Original paired traces retain event-stream HTTP429 responses after forced offline/reload and bounded retry, plus expected authorization/conflict errors. The observed content/transfer/recovery outcomes remain functional. Do not describe this as a pristine network run or an exhaustive deployment latency guarantee.",
    "The actual progression action and Return to Current Objective are distinct: a remembered reading leaf may remain after progression until the explicit current-objective return reveals the latest leaf.",
    "Captured cancellation/expiry/revocation are controlled synthetic adverse conditions. The review does not claim every possible device, provider or production failure combination was visually exercised."
